                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Iddings to Mr.
                            Hay.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram—Paraphrase.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >United States Embassy</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Rome</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian" when="1900-07-03"><hi
                                rendition="#italic">July 3, 1900</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>(Mr. Iddings, chargé d’affaires, reports the receipt of the Department’s circular
                        telegram,<anchor n="1" xml:id="d454-f1"/> of July 2, and compliance with its
                    instructions.)</p>
            </div>
